     :math-program "(define (digit-range? n place)\n  (let ((d (math/digit-at n place)))\n    (and (>= d 0) (<= d 9))))\n(and (digit-range? 3428 0) (digit-range? 3428 1) (digit-range? 3428 2) (digit-range? 3428 3))"
