     :cs-program "(define (log2-doubling? x)\n  (< (abs (- (math/log2 (* 2 x)) (+ 1 (math/log2 x)))) 1e-9))\n(log2-doubling? 16)"
     :invariant "∀ n ∈ ℝ. log2(2^n) = n" :meta "Inverse of powers of 2. If broken, the base constant is wrong. See book-of-math ch 9.")
